      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLACK HAVOC (2) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish second, beaten 4.5 lengths (22.97) at this track in a Novice race over 400m. Capable of going well again. CONFLICTED (3) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (23.60) in a Novice race at this track. Better than last start and can bounce back. FROTHING (6) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Cannington behind Rupee's Special (22.68) in a Novice race. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. The form from her last run stacks up well. Can feature again. MISS CHERRY PIE (1) is not to be discarded.",
